{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a690fd28da5052d6","name":"Mobile Spacedock 220","source":{"id":"source:reference-a690fd28da5052d6","title":"Mobile Spacedock 220","revision":20247,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:29:28Z","sha256":"c114b35fa4f607b208a6b9f7626238f6b723f3584aa84026cea65cd24de67388","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20247","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Mobile%20Spacedock%20220&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a690fd28da5052d6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Rendili Star Drive Mobile Spacedock 220 is essentially a mobile shipyard, offering drydock services to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"}," up to the size of a ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["ShaShore"]},"-Class Frigate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/ShaShore-Class_Frigate","referenceId":"reference:bd4ef28aa103bb0e"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," has one such Spacedock, which normally requires a crew of thousands but is currently understaffed. Recruiting loyal technicians and mechanics for the Spacedock has become a significant goal for the Galactic Alliance Core Fleet.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Most of the dock consists of an enormous metal frame that envelops a ship moored inside for repair. Large areas within the dock can be cordoned off by projected force fields to provide an atmosphere when extensive repairs are required. The metal frame is attached to a large central spine that includes the dock's power generators, crew quarters, machine shops, thrusters, and primary engine.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although the dock is mobile, it cannot move while ships are docked. Moreover, the ribs of the metal frame must be retracted before the dock can make hyperspace jumps. Preparations usually take 12 to 24 hours, but the crew can reduce this time to 2 hours in an emergency. This results in damage to some partially stored equipment and systems, and takes days to sort out after the jump.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Mobile Spacedock 220 Statistics (CL 20)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal (Station) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Station"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Station"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -8; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 11 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 11), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 68; +14 Armor\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 2,100; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 20; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shiel